# Kalonlife brand colors

These values are the visual source of truth. Do not introduce other brand colors.

| Role | Name | Hex |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Primary | Deep Teal | `#042F34` |
| Secondary | Mint Green | `#B5F2DB` |
| Neutral | Pale Blue Gray | `#E4EEF0` |
| Neutral | White | `#FFFFFF` |
| Accent | Warm Yellow | `#FFC933` |
| Dark | Charcoal Teal | `#16232B` |

- Primary gradient is **Gradient 1** only, defined once as `--kl-gradient-1` in `src/styles/brand.css`. Do not invent or swap in another primary gradient.
- `#042F34` for strong primary text and dark UI.
- `#FFFFFF` for clean backgrounds and contrast.
- `#B5F2DB` for secondary highlights and soft sections.
- `#E4EEF0` for subtle backgrounds.
- `#FFC933` only as a sparse accent.
- `#16232B` for deep contrast.
- Style: premium, clean, modern, wellness. Avoid excessive gradients and excessive yellow.
